+\cvsubsubsec{\texttt{groupCoord}: coordination number between two groups.}{sec:cvc_groupCoord}
+\labelkey{colvar|groupCoord}
+
+The \texttt{groupCoord \{...\}} block defines
+a coordination number between virtual particles located at the centers of mass of
+\texttt{group1} and \texttt{group2}. Its value is between 0 and 1.
+It is a essentially shorthand for \texttt{coordNum}
+with the options \texttt{group1CenterOnly yes} and \texttt{group2CenterOnly yes}.
+It takes the same parameters as \texttt{coordNum}.
+
 
